  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"1999-11-05T13:54:00Z\"\u003e6 November 1999\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Statement in Response to Media Release by Graham Kelly of 5 November 1999, ‘Nats poised to privatise Housing NZ’ \n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Tony Ryall\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Housing New Zealand Ltd\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Is it full moon tonight?\u0026#34; asked HNZ Minister, Tony Ryall. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Labour\u0026#39;s Housing Spokesman, Graham Kelly, has really started to lose the plot. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;He is clearly a man under pressure. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There are no plans to privatise HNZ,\u0026#34; said Mr Ryall. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "\"Is it full moon tonight?\" asked HNZ Minister, Tony Ryall. \"Labour's Housing Spokesman, Graham Kelly, has really started to lose the plot. \"He is clearly a man under pressure. \"There are no plans to privatise HNZ,\" said Mr Ryall.",
